	(text "The ESP32-PICO-V3-02 module with its supply decoupling, antenna and matching, reset, boot strap and\npull-ups, the I2C pull-ups, the UART and IR series resistors, and buttons A and B.\n\nMain parts: U1 ESP32-PICO-V3-02, E1 antenna, S1 S2 buttons"
