	(text "USB-C with its fuse, CC resistors and ESD diodes, the CH9102F USB-UART bridge and the DTR/RTS auto-reset,\nthe test pads; the LCD connector and backlight switch, the buzzer, the STICKIO and 4-pin headers, the Grove\nport, and the rails' ESD diodes and bulk capacitors.\n\nMain parts: J2 USB-C, U2 CH9102F, Q1 LMBT3904DW1T1G, JP1-JP5, U3 LCD connector, U4 SGM2578, LS1 buzzer, P1\nSTICKIO, P2, J1 Grove"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 80.01 0)
		(effects
