	(text "The charger and the battery, the two P-MOSFET switches from the cell to the system rail, the power latch\n(HOLD), the power key and the RTC wake, the battery divider, and the red and IR LEDs.\n\nMain parts: U5 TP4057, J3 battery, Q3 Q4 LP3218DT1G, Q7 SI2302, S3 power key, Q5 SS8050, D24 red LED, IR1"
