		(uuid "95845485-82b8-5150-a85a-97a45d597992")
	)
	(text "Every part, pin and net of the M5StickC Plus2, with the values the vendor documents: connectivity\ndocumented from the vendor's public documentation, with Kleidos additions and corrections listed on\npage 1 (M5Stack's M5StickC Plus2 schematic v0.5 and its docs page, cited in README.md and\nnetlist.yaml beside this file). Layout and symbols are this project's. No footprints, no PCB, no part\nnumbers beyond the documented ones. Values are as the vendor prints them (10KΩ, 22R/1%). A value of\nNC means not fitted: those parts are marked DNP. Reference designators are the vendor's, not\nrenumbered. Nets the vendor left unnamed carry names of ours (LNA_IN, Q4_G...). Some nets carry two\nvendor labels and are drawn under one: GPI36 (also GPIO25), GPIO4 (also HOLD), UTX (also RXD), URX\n(also TXD) and +3.3V (also +3V3OUT). Zones: columns 1-8 and rows A-F, 50 mm apart, printed in the\nborder."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 88.605 0)
		(effects
